transcript:
In this tutorial we build a creative portfolio landing page.
We place a low-poly interactive 3D model in the center. As the mouse moves, the model tilts toward the cursor using lerp (linear interpolation) inside requestAnimationFrame:
model.rotation.x += (targetRotationX - model.rotation.x) * 0.05;
model.rotation.y += (targetRotationY - model.rotation.y) * 0.05;
This creates an organic, responsive feel that draws the user into the experience.
Combine this with split-text reveal animations on headings using GSAP SplitType. Words fade and translate up from below an overflow: hidden container.
